  "result": "Perfect! All 46 tests pass. I've implemented the invoice numbering system:\n\n**`src/numbering.js`** \u2014 `nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`:\n- Extracts the year from issueDate (YYYY-MM-DD format)\n- Filters existing numbers for that year\n- Finds the max counter and increments it (starting at 0001 for new years)\n- Returns `ok('INV-2026-0042')` with zero-padded 4-digit counter\n- Returns `fail('DATE_INVALID')` if date format is invalid\n\n**`src/invoices.js`** \u2014 `issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)`:\n- Requires invoice.status to be 'draft' (else returns NOT_DRAFT)\n- Calls `nextInvoiceNumber` to get the next number\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with number set and status changed to 'issued'\n- Preserves all other invoice properties and doesn't mutate the original\n\n**Tests** (12 new, 46 total):\n- `nextInvoiceNumber`: starts at 0001, increments correctly, handles multiple years, ignores malformed numbers, validates date format, pads with zeros\n- `issueInvoice`: assigns number and changes status, rejects non-draft, doesn't mutate original, handles existing numbers from same year, preserves all properties",
